{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんおはようございます!佐藤詩織です۬৺۬☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は七夕ですねー!\nということは、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぶちゃんのお誕生日です!♡\n*･゜ﾟ･*:.｡..｡.:*･'(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)'･*:.｡. .｡.:*･゜ﾟ･*\nおめでとうはぶちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…いや、わたしはハーブって呼んでるんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーブは、お洒落だし優しいし面白いし、ドラマでも近い役柄だから、一緒にいること多くて、いつも和んでる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも本当にありがとうハーブ♡(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーブが幸せな19歳の1年間を過ごせる様、一緒に色々なこと楽しもうね!♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8K434BT3PMP9S0GYX6ZNC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしのいまの願いは髪を切ること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなタナバタなday 本日15時から、あしたの14時まで、握手会応募始まります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ沢山あるので、是非是非沢山お話しに来てください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH8K55SPT0XA50JV6CM18CJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また着て〜と沢山言っていただいたので、2ndも、浴衣着ることにしたよー♡\nこれとは違うの着よっかなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ着るかはお楽しみ!\\꒰ ˘ ³˘꒱/♡\n前回来れなかった方も来て頂けたら嬉しいな♡\n是非是非たくさんお話しにきてね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、ばいさ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詩織**"}],"source":"archive"}